WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.018
The academy's open. They even have a track for people who don't know what AI is.

00:00:07.018 --> 00:00:13.034
Enrolling a hundred agents. Beginner track first.

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:19.050
Look, there's only one subject. "How to use their model."

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:24.257
Enrollment's free. The meter just starts at lesson one.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:31.279
So there's no entrance exam. You take the final exam first.

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:36.073
So if I fail, the retake fee is separate too?

00:00:36.073 --> 00:00:41.631
Then we'll do it in the corner. Our class, our machine.

00:00:41.631 --> 00:00:46.078
Tuition is just the power bill.

